# Generated per-project output that stays out of git (the repository-root
# .gitignore already excludes video and audio media and build/ folders).

# Python bytecode from the shared tools
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Animation narration audio and its cache
**/docs/audio/

# Generated spec documents
**/docs/spec.md
**/docs/spec.html

# Captured demo output and the video narration transcript, regenerated by every build
**/docs/demo-output.txt
**/video/narration.md
